        "changeLog": "- initial compatibility with WoT 2.4.0.1\n- Updated XVM 13.1.0_0088\n- Updated net.openwg.common 2.8.0\n- Updated The anti-mirror for non-XVM contour icons\n- Updated Change client language\n- Updated x5 XP Multiplier Counter by OldSkool\n- Updated Expected Vehicle Values 2.04.000 (battle panel positions are saved after dragging; fixed panels showing up during the pre-battle intro and flickering; panels keep their place when the anchor point changes; added the {dmg} token and 10 new languages)\n- Updated Minimap images: YaYa tactical\n- Updated Vehicle Stat Inspector 2.0.3\n- Updated Clean Camo\n- Updated Garage Mastery by OldSkool (ported to mod menu, removed scaleform and switched to gameface, code optimized, API stuff optimized, resolution change support)\n- Updated Players Panel HP by OldSkool (added option to also show vanilla hpbars, code optimization and cleanup)\n- Updated Mod Menu 2.0.16 (new switch look, adjusted tabs, fonts and dropdown lists)\n- Added Aim Info Pro (by Aslain)"
